<title>FRANCE: FRANCE-TELECOM-DELAY URGENT.</title>
<headline>FRANCE-TELECOM-DELAY URGENT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said in a statement on Tuesday he had decided to delay the sale of shares in France Telecom SA by four weeks due to early elections.</p>
<p>He said that the partial privatisation, which could be France's biggest, needed an important public relations campaign which was difficult to conduct with an election campaign.</p>
<p>French President Jacques Chirac on Monday announced a snap two-round parliamentary election for May 25 and June 1.</p>
